  "name": "DPX Melee Case",
  "slug": "dpx-melee-case",
  "teaser": "A custom configurable storage case dedicated exclusively to melee weapons.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/vkZ0J9nrvt57XVCL5x1TM5mnt3greBU3DmrRPWKT.jpg",
  "downloads": 1154,
  "favourites_count": 11,
  "description": "<h1>DPX Melee Case</h1>\n<p>DPX Melee Case adds a custom storage container dedicated exclusively to melee weapons.</p>\n<h2>Features</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Custom 3D model and AssetBundle</li>\n<li>Custom inventory icon</li>\n<li>Stores melee weapons only</li>\n<li>External size: 4x2</li>\n<li>Internal storage grid: 8x8</li>\n<li>Available from Jaeger LL1</li>\n<li>Default price: 250,000₽</li>\n<li>Default stock: 999</li>\n<li>Fully configurable through <code>config.json</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Configuration</h2>\n<p>The following options can be changed:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Enable or disable the mod</li>\n<li>Trader</li>\n<li>Loyalty level</li>\n<li>Price</li>\n<li>Stock quantity</li>\n<li>External case size</li>\n<li>Internal storage size</li>\n<li>Debug logging</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<p>Extract the archive directly into your SPT installation folder.</p>\n<p>The archive contains both the required server mod and BepInEx client plugin.</p>\n<h2>Compatibility</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>SPT 4.0.13</li>\n<li>EFT 0.16.9.40087</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Feedback and Bug Reports</h2>\n<p>If you encounter any bugs, errors, compatibility issues, or unexpected behavior, please report them in the comments section.</p>\n<p>When possible, include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A clear description of the issue</li>\n<li>The steps needed to reproduce it</li>\n<li>Your SPT version</li>\n<li>Your server logs</li>\n<li>Your BepInEx logs</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Known issues and useful feedback are always welcome and help improve future versions of the mod.</p>\n",
