      "version": "1.0.5",
      "description": "<p>DPX Melee Case v1.0.5</p>\n<p>Fixed</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Rebuilt the custom prefab using the native EFT Weapon Case rendering structure.</li>\n<li>Fixed the inventory icon remaining stuck in an infinite loading state.</li>\n<li>Restored native 3D icon generation for the inventory and trader screens.</li>\n<li>Replaced the incorrect generic shader with the native opaque EFT shader.</li>\n<li>Fixed the washed-out, overly bright and partially transparent appearance.</li>\n<li>Fixed flickering in trader and preview interfaces.</li>\n<li>Removed the obsolete DPX-MeleeCaseIconFix BepInEx plugin.</li>\n<li>Removed the embedded Sprite and <code>PreviewPivot.overrideIcon</code> workaround.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Important update note</p>\n<p>EFT/SPT stores generated inventory icons in a persistent cache. After updating from an older version, the previous bright or white icon may remain temporarily.</p>\n<p>Restart the client first. If the old icon remains, the specific cached icon entry may need to be regenerated.</p>\n<p>Do not reinstall the old DPX-MeleeCaseIconFix plugin.</p>\n<p>Unchanged</p>\n<ul>\n<li>External size: 4x2</li>\n<li>Internal grid: 8x8</li>\n<li>Melee weapon filter</li>\n<li>Trader offers and prices</li>\n<li>Existing gameplay balance</li>\n</ul>\n",
